{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01460",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 5.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Hmm, hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.89,
      "end_seconds": 10.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.11,
      "end_seconds": 18.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a muffled voice, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.2,
      "end_seconds": 22.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.78,
      "end_seconds": 26.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "About... well, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.95,
      "end_seconds": 30.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.22,
      "end_seconds": 65.77,
      "duration_seconds": 33.55,
      "text": "Right, about a four out of ten. Oh, um, and a severe sore throat. That's been about the same, about two weeks. So, you know, about severe sore throat, about a four out of ten. Oh, there's difficulty swallowing as well. Mm, you know, with difficulty swallowing, it's severe, honestly. I, I did have noisy breathing at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.57,
      "end_seconds": 70.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.37,
      "end_seconds": 77.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.1,
      "end_seconds": 81.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.58,
      "end_seconds": 87.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.11,
      "end_seconds": 94.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.8,
      "end_seconds": 111.64,
      "duration_seconds": 15.84,
      "text": "I have eczema, for nearly five years. Hmm, I've got low haemoglobin. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. Acid reflux, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.62,
      "end_seconds": 120.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "Right, so eczema and low haemoglobin are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Alright, have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.65,
      "end_seconds": 146.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I had my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.23,
      "end_seconds": 156.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.16,
      "end_seconds": 170.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.77,
      "end_seconds": 177.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.78,
      "end_seconds": 191.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.09,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream, when needed. I do miss it now and then, to be fair. Ah, I'm on iron tablets, once a day for my blood count."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.62,
      "end_seconds": 206.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any cough or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.61,
      "end_seconds": 212.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Right, no cough or rash, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.81,
      "end_seconds": 217.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Alright, anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.24,
      "end_seconds": 219.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.16,
      "end_seconds": 223.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.26,
      "end_seconds": 240.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Okay, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.25,
      "end_seconds": 263.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Okay: weight 66 kilos, pulse 101. And blood pressure 140 over 80, height 179 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.85,
      "end_seconds": 269.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Right, now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.0,
      "end_seconds": 273.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.99,
      "end_seconds": 278.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.26,
      "end_seconds": 300.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "You are sitting forward, drooling, and your breathing is noisy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.08,
      "end_seconds": 302.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.28,
      "end_seconds": 307.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.46,
      "end_seconds": 338.43,
      "duration_seconds": 13.97,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a possible airway infection that needs emergency care, or it might be severe tonsillitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.82,
      "end_seconds": 342.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Erm, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.89,
      "end_seconds": 364.7,
      "duration_seconds": 16.81,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible airway infection that needs emergency care do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for an urgent airway assessment because of stridor and drooling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 365.8,
      "end_seconds": 368.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.04,
      "end_seconds": 372.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Thursday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.53,
      "end_seconds": 399.53,
      "duration_seconds": 26.0,
      "text": "Do not lie flat, I am calling an ambulance now. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'm going to send a referral to the emergency ENT team. If the breathing gets harder, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's review you straight away. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.06,
      "end_seconds": 402.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.71,
      "end_seconds": 404.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}